		{
			dependencies: ["6AE36CD4F39DAB08"]
			description: [
				"Mixes dusts together."
				""
				"For now, you'll be using it to make &6Energetic Alloy Dust&r which is made from &6Redstone&r, &6Gold Dust&r and &6Glowstone Dust&r. "
				""
				"You can get some Glowstone by mixing &6Tricalcium Phosphate Dust&r and &6Gold Dust&r."
